  "notes": "Source is the county's official public notice of election (lists every contest in ballot order). The 13 precinct sample ballot PDFs are image-only (no extractable text), so per-precinct mapping was not verified. Supervisors elected BY DISTRICT: District 2 and District 3 seats on the 2026 ballot (voters see only their district's race). Vacancy offices: County Auditor and County Sheriff (to fill a vacancy). Township clerk races in Jackson and Sac townships show 'No Candidate'. Measures: County Public Measure A (jail bond, county-wide) and Jackson Township Public Measure B (Jackson Township voters only). Ballot heading on both reads 'Shall the following amendment to the Public Measure X be adopted?' (as printed)."
